\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces Experimental pipeline. Each generation fine-tunes on synthetic text mixed with real data at ratio $r_t$. Spectral monitoring extracts last-layer embeddings from held-out data, computes a singular value decomposition (SVD), and derives SLV, $r_{\text  {eff}}$, and $\sigma _1$. A proportional controller (dashed) can adjust $r_{t+1}$ based on the SLV rate of change. The three phases (decompression (I), onset (II), and acceleration (III)) are annotated along the generation axis.}}{3}{figure.caption.2}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:pipeline}{{2}{3}{Experimental pipeline. Each generation fine-tunes on synthetic text mixed with real data at ratio $r_t$. Spectral monitoring extracts last-layer embeddings from held-out data, computes a singular value decomposition (SVD), and derives SLV, $r_{\text {eff}}$, and $\sigma _1$. A proportional controller (dashed) can adjust $r_{t+1}$ based on the SLV rate of change. The three phases (decompression (I), onset (II), and acceleration (III)) are annotated along the generation axis}{figure.caption.2}{}}
